\begin{minipage}{\textwidth}
\color{ink}
\textbf{Research aim.} This research investigates how prediction feedback and gradient paths shape test-time adaptation. Using IT$^3$ as a concrete setting, we will analyze how fixed and moving references affect learning dynamics and identify conditions for stable adaptation and improved prediction accuracy. The study combines mathematical analysis with controlled experiments on trained models.
\end{minipage}
\par\vspace{0.36in}
